==Description==
The '''Carols Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 7 of the premium [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|160}} or {{Robux|54}} ({{Robux|43}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|590}} or {{Robux|371}} ({{Robux|294}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

The '''Carols Nametag''' has orange to light orange gradient text and outline. Various musical notes scroll behind the text, and musical notes also appear out of it.

